# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Orgrimmar (March of the Silithid, Belgrom's Betrayed for later, training) -> Azshara (Loh'atu,
# Valormok, the hippogryphs, Kim'jael, the Ruins of Eldarath and Cuely's vials, Jediga and Xylem) ->
# fly to Orgrimmar (Jes'rimon) -> Thunder Bluff (Magatha, Hamuul)
# -> fly to Gadgetzan -> Un'Goro Crater -> Gadgetzan -> fly to Orgrimmar -> zeppelin to the Undercity
# (Andron Gant, Chemist Cuely, Balthazad) -> the Bulwark -> the Western and Eastern Plaguelands ->
# Light's Hope Chapel.

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  accept 4494                           -- Zilzibin Drumlore, Valley of Spirits
  accept 3504                           -- Belgrom Rockmaul, Valley of Honor
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Azshara
  zone Azshara
  goto 11.4,78.2 "Azshara"

step Ride into Azshara
  zone Azshara
  tip Ride east along the road out of Splintertree. Loh'atu waits at the Shadowsong Shrine just off the road, a few steps west of the Alliance's Talrendis Point: come in from the west and keep clear of the Azshara Sentinels and Jarrodenus (elite).
  accept 5535                         -- Loh'atu
  accept 5536

step Haldarr Encampment: kill these as you meet them
  zone Azshara
  tip The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins just north of the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs camp a little further north.
  kill 6117 quest 5535.2              -- Highborne Lichling walks around Shadowsong Shrine: look inside the circle on the map
  kill 6116 quest 5535.1
  kill 6127 quest 5536.3
  kill 6126 quest 5536.2
  kill 6125 quest 5536.1

step Loh'atu
  tip Back to Loh'atu at the shrine; stay west of the Talrendis Point guards.
  turnin 5535
  turnin 5536

step Valormok
  tip Follow the road north to Valormok, the Horde camp.
  accept 3381 optional                -- Sanath Lim-yo, at the east edge of the camp: no experience, only a teleport to Azshara Tower

