  zone Azshara
  tip Ride south-west to the ruins. The four tablets lie among the ruins, guarded by Spitelash naga; any Siren or Myrmidon can carry Kim'jael's rune.
  collect 13815 quest 5534
  collect 10540 quest 3517
  collect 10538 quest 3517
  collect 10541 quest 3517
  collect 10539 quest 3517

