step Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly to Thunder Bluff; it is on the way to Camp Mojache. No flight path there yet? Fly to Camp Taurajo and ride west through Mulgore. Hamuul and Magatha are on the Elder Rise; Druids and Paladins train here (Turak Runetotem, Alodan the Hopeful).
  accept 3761

