step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades to the Bulwark, the Forsaken fort on the border.
  accept 5901                         -- Mickey Levine
  note Take a Box of Incendiaries from the crate next to Derrington for Scarlet Diversions, done on the way back. Equip the Argent Dawn Commission: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it.
  turnin 5094                         -- High Executor Derrington
  accept 5096
  accept 5405                         -- Argent Officer Garush
  turnin 5405
  accept 5407 optional
  accept 5408 optional

step Janice Felstone
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades, past the Bulwark. Felstone Farm is the first farm along the road; Janice waits in the house.
  accept 5021                         -- Upstairs
  turnin 5021                         -- Janice's Parcel, beside the house; inside
  accept 5023
  note Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity.

step Scarlet forward camp
  tip The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner.
  goto 40.7,52.0
  interact 176088
  complete 5096

