step Eastern Plaguelands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip With Carlin's quest in your log, slain Scourge sometimes leave a Darrowshire Spirit; talk to it to free it. Kill undead on the ride south-west to Darrowshire.
  kill 11064 quest 5211.1 "Free Darrowshire Spirits: talk to them"

